<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BRIGHTPOINT STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BRIGHTPOINT STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of Brightpoint Inc as intermediate-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Brightpoint gained 11/32 to 29-27/32.</p>
</text>
